      "kind": "lede",
      "html": "<p>Street works records are made outdoors, in traffic, on someone else's highway. Each opening must be reinstated to standard, inspected, and defended if the highway authority raises a defect months later. The best tool gets the record written while you stand over the reinstatement.</p>"
    },
