      "heading": "Who can sign the works off",
      "html": "<p>NRSWA sets competence rules for people who carry out and supervise street works. Section 67 requires street works that break up the street to be supervised by someone with a prescribed supervisor qualification, with a person holding a prescribed trained operative qualification on site. The record should tie the works to the qualified person.</p><p>Quickler records the operative and supervisor on each inspection, with a time. It does not check a card is valid. Keep your own record of current cards. This is not legal advice.</p>"
